subckt dut (D G B S)
model DIODE diode is=1e-14 n=1
CBD (B net0) capacitor c=1p
CBS (B net1) capacitor c=1p
CGB (B G) capacitor c=1p
CGD (net0 G) capacitor c=1p
CGS (net1 G) capacitor c=1p
DBD (B net0) DIODE
DBS (B net1) DIODE
G1 (net0 net1 G net1) vccs gm=1m
RD (D net0) resistor r=1k
RS (net1 S) resistor r=1k
